<title>MEXICO: La Moderna to boost cigarette output.</title>
<headline>La Moderna to boost cigarette output.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cigarrera La Moderna, a unit of conglomerate Empresas La Moderna, expects to produce 27 billion cigarettes this year versus 25 billion last year, company officials said.</p>
<p>&quot;In 1996 we produced 25 billion units and in 1997 we expect to produce 27 billion units,&quot; Eugenio Najera, the director of Cigarrera La Moderna, told Reuters in an interview.</p>
</text>
